# --- Dependencias (Recursivo en todas las subcarpetas) ---
**/node_modules/
**/bower_components/

# --- Compilación y Salida (Build) ---
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.turbo/
**/tsstyle/

# --- Variables de Entorno y Secretos ---
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local
**/*.env.sample
**/sync-conflict-*

# --- Logs y Debugging ---
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/pids/
**/*.pid
**/*.seed
**/*.snapshot

# --- Herramientas de Testing ---
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/.jest/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/test-results/
**/playwright/.cache/

# --- IDEs y Editores de Código ---
**/.vscode/
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
**/.idea/
**/*.suo
**/*.ntvs*
**/*.njsproj
**/*.sln
**/*.sw?

# --- Sistema Operativo (macOS / Linux / Windows) ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# --- Base de Datos Local (PostgreSQL/MongoDB si se montan en el repo) ---
**/data/
**/pgdata/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite

# --- Odoo (Si el proyecto integra módulos específicos) ---
**/*.pyc
**/__pycache__/